nodecode-dexio is a rewrite of dexio-wiki's dexio-wiki/hermes-plugin:

  https://github.com/dexio-wiki/hermes-plugin
  commit d05715098148e0335ceaf87a58caaa22d19ff3ff
  MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Forrest Zhang (LICENSE)

What was rewritten: the plugin's memory provider, whole. The six tools keep
their names, descriptions and parameters (dexio_search, dexio_read,
dexio_list, dexio_write, dexio_edit, dexio_append), the aliases models reach
for out of habit (content, old_string, new_string) and the rule that a
missing new_text is not an empty one; the wire keeps its shape (one JSON-RPC
tools/call per request to <url>/mcp, Authorization: Bearer, Accept JSON or
text/event-stream, a plain JSON body or a short server-sent stream, and the
second content item of a read as the page itself); the recall before each
turn keeps its shape (the turn's message clipped to 300 characters, the
"## From your Dexio wiki" block with each page's title, path and up to three
matching lines, a per-query cache cleared by a write, and the 1-to-10
max_results); and the block of words the model is given about the wiki keeps
the original's advice -- search first, update rather than duplicate, link with
[[path]], give a one-line note, never file a secret. A tool's answer is
rendered as the lines a model reads -- a page a line, with its path, its
version and the lines that matched -- where the original handed back the
server's JSON; the data is the same.

What was left out, and why: the Hermes Desktop pane (dashboard/plugin_api.py
and desktop/plugin.js) and the local activity record it polls, because a
Nodecode cell has no Desktop pane to feed -- the recall and the tools are the
whole of what it kept, and the record was a view of them, never an input; and
the Hermes config files and environment overrides ($HERMES_HOME/dexio.json,
DEXIO_URL, DEXIO_API_KEY lookup order), whose answers the cell's own section
gives (api_key, api_key_env, url, auto_recall, max_results, recall_chars,
timeout_seconds), with DEXIO_API_KEY still read from the environment and
DEXIO_API_KEY still the fallback when the section names nothing. The agent
name a write carries is the section's `agent` (default "nodecode") rather
than a Hermes profile name, and /dexio -- showing the wiki and its page count,
or searching it -- stands in for the plugin's memory status config.

LICENSE is the plugin repository's LICENSE, unchanged.
